written request to:

tracetronic GmbH
Stuttgarter Straße 3
01189 Dresden
Germany 

Your request should include: 

* The name of the component or binary file(s) for which you are requesting the source code
* The name and version number of the tracetronic product containing the binary
* The license number of your license
